  </developer>

  <description>
    <p>
      Etiketto is a label designer for the Brother VC-500W colour label printer
      (also sold as ColAura), which prints on ZINK paper. It brings the workflow of Brother's own editor,
      only available for Windows, macOS and phones, to the Linux desktop.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Finds the printer on the network by itself</li>
      <li>Detects the inserted cassette (9 to 50 mm), the remaining tape and cassette details</li>
      <li>Automatic length that grows with the content, or a fixed length in millimetres or inches</li>
      <li>Text in any installed font, images and photos, QR codes and barcodes</li>
      <li>Background colours and images printed edge to edge, borders</li>
      <li>Vivid colours or black and white, full, half or no cut, colour adjustment</li>
      <li>Printer problems explained in plain words, with a way to report a problem</li>
      <li>Live preview at print resolution, templates, PNG export</li>
      <li>User documentation in English and German</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Etiketto is not affiliated with Brother Industries. Brother, ColAura and
      VC-500W are trademarks of their owners; ZINK is a trademark of ZINK Holdings LLC.
    </p>
  </description>

